-28T10:30:27Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T12:00:27Z","overview":"Gene Autry and the Cass County Boys are unjustly arrested as bank bandits. Released by police as decoys to locate the loot, Gene and the boys find themselves in trouble with the real bank robbers.","genres":["Western","Movie","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_ClassicMovieWesterns_us","title":"The Last Round-Up","released":"2026-11-28T12:00:27Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T12:00:27Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T13:30:27Z","overview":"Gene Autry is a cattle rancher determined to protect the interests of neighboring ranchers and Indians against unscrupulous land manipulators when local authorities plan to build an aqueduct.","genres":["Western","Movie","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_ClassicMovieWesterns_us","title":"Invitation to a Gunfighter","released":"2026-11-28T13:30:27Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T13:30:27Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T15:30:27Z","overview":"Screen legend Yul Brynner turns in a magnificent performance as a gunfighter who must do battle with his most formidable adversary - his own conscience - in this gripping, double-barreled western full of surprise twists and colorful villainy.","genres":["Western","Movie","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_ClassicMovieWesterns_us","title":"Bad Company","released":"2026-11-28T15:30:27Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T15:30:27Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T17:30:27Z","overview":"A group of mismatched young robbers attempts to make it as outlaws on the frontier, but their ill-fated heists quickly reveal just how unprepared they are for life in the Wild West.","genres":["Western","Movie","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_ClassicMovieWesterns_us","title":"Return To Lonesome Dove","released":"2026-11-28T17:30:27Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T17:30:27Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T19:30:27Z","overview":"Back in Texas, Capt. Call organizes a mustang drive to Montana. He hires a Gideon, a former Texas Ranger, to head the drive. Newt falls into trouble in is rescued by a crusty rancher named Dunnegan.","genres":["Series","Western","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_ClassicMovieWesterns_us","title":"Return To Lonesome Dove","released":"2026-11-28T19:30:27Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T19:30:27Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T21:30:27Z","overview":"Gideon's mustang drive encounters problems. Agostina must fend off the unwanted advances of cowboys. Call makes his way to Clara's ranch, and then moves on to Montana.","genres":["Series","Western","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_ClassicMovieWesterns_us","title":"Return To Lonesome Dove","released":"2026-11-28T21:30:27Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T21:30:27Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T23:15:27Z","overview":"Clara's ranch meets an fiery fate, and she decides to join with Gideon. Call has the misfortune to meet up with the desperado Cherokee Jack. Dunnegan tells Newt of his inheritance plans.","genres":["Series","Western","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_ClassicMovieWesterns_us","title":"Return To Lonesome Dove","released":"2026-11-28T23:15:27Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T23:15:27Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T01:00:27Z","overview":"A range war is erupting in Montana, and Call and Dunnegan meet alone to settle their differences. Cherokee Jack is running amok. Call tells Newt about their true relationship.","genres":["Series","Western","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_ClassicMovieWesterns_us","title":"Classic Movie Westerns – Live","released":"2026-11-29T01:00:27Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T01:00:27Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","genres":["Movies"]},{"id":"ftv_ClassicMovieWesterns_us","title":"Classic Movie Westerns – Live","released":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T06:00:00Z","genres":["Movies"]},{"id":"ftv_ClassicMovieWesterns_us","title":"Classic Movie Westerns – Live","released":"2026-11-29T06:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T06:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T09:00:00Z","genres":["Movies"]},{"id":"ftv_ClassicMovieWesterns_us","title":"Classic Movie Westerns – Live","released":"2026-11-29T09:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T09:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T12:00:00Z","genres":["Movies"]},{"id":"ftv_